---
title: AllocationRun State Machine
---
stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Snapshotted : SO accepted, allocation attempt created with input snapshot (ordered by AcceptedAt, then SO code)
    Snapshotted --> Planning : filter warehouses in service radius, Available > 0, MLOR, then weighted-score FEFO greedy
    Planning --> Planning : optimistic-lock conflict, rollback, reload stock and re-plan (max 3 retries)
    Planning --> Committed : every line covered, reservation + shelf-life price committed in one transaction
    Planning --> Short : at least one line cannot be fully covered, whole SO rolled back
    Planning --> Conflict : still conflicting after 3 retries, moved to technical retry queue
    Planning --> Failed : technical error or invalid input
    Committed --> [*]
    Short --> [*]
    Conflict --> [*]
    Failed --> [*]
